{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">《美食新聞報道》繼續帶大家四處尋覓佳餚！首節有暉哥（林映暉）與大廚陳國強在馬來西亞梳邦再也，直擊名廚聚腳的私房酒樓；第二節則由施焯日與蔡景行帶大家回到香港，在銅鑼灣品嚐性價比極高的半自助午餐。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong>第一站：馬來西亞梳邦再也 私房古早味海鮮</strong></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">暉哥與大廚陳國強深入馬來西亞，帶大家品嚐一間名廚交流聚腳的私房酒樓。餐廳主打古早風味，海鮮食材極具新鮮度，當中有三道必試招牌菜：</p><ul class=\"tiptap-bullet-list\"><li></li><li></li><li></li></ul><p style=\"text-align: left;\">喜宴 HEI YIN </p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">地址：2/F, 209 Ma Tau Wai Rd, Ma Tau Chung</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"2ede58b4-0589-4055-a94e-9b32d69a8a82.png.webp\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/file/2026/08/2026H9KcMbYAjw1786936779.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"2ede58b4-0589-4055-a94e-9b32d69a8a82.png.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"84c563ea-3430-4b6e-ae0b-9921f4ffe07f.png.webp\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/file/2026/08/2026u7WdvbTY3z1786936779.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"84c563ea-3430-4b6e-ae0b-9921f4ffe07f.png.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"1b1a4c99-fde2-43d8-8fe4-2335e5ef1b17.png.webp\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/file/2026/08/2026LIG2Hx2ygy1786936780.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"1b1a4c99-fde2-43d8-8fe4-2335e5ef1b17.png.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong>第二站：銅鑼灣高性價比 $128半自助午餐</strong></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">施焯日與蔡景行為大家發掘銅鑼灣的抵食之選！這間西餐廳推出日日同價的超抵半自助午餐，只需$128（已包含加一服務費），即可享用一款精緻主菜。此外，每日更會無限量供應6款沙律、2款冷盤、4款熱盤小食與2款炸物，款式會不定時更換，性價比極高。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">精選主菜推介：</p><ul class=\"tiptap-bullet-list\"><li></li><li></li></ul><p style=\"text-align: left;\">協奏坊西餐廳 </p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">地址：香港銅鑼灣信德街8號香港珀麗酒店2樓</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"67298dd8-b464-4ffc-8a94-d1af1521a83d.png.webp\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/file/2026/08/2026uN0yjBgaul1786936779.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"67298dd8-b464-4ffc-8a94-d1af1521a83d.png.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"965efb09-916d-4dc4-b35b-8dc385912943.png.webp\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/file/2026/08/2026TLKP0H3AQf1786936779.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"965efb09-916d-4dc4-b35b-8dc385912943.png.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"3838bd15-7837-4424-a974-64d8c8fa821b.png.webp\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/file/2026/08/2026n4vzhRKbkf1786936779.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"3838bd15-7837-4424-a974-64d8c8fa821b.png.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"b2d32962-83d6-41d1-9df7-bce5654b0935.png.webp\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/file/2026/08/2026jePbDETci01786936780.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"b2d32962-83d6-41d1-9df7-bce5654b0935.png.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"1500d7cd-69e0-4e1d-98ee-d7ae739f694b.png.webp\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/file/2026/08/2026WeV1LPlJXP1786936780.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"1500d7cd-69e0-4e1d-98ee-d7ae739f694b.png.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-17T14:08:53.789438+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":411,"images":8,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}